{{Short description|Administrative entry restrictions}}
'''Visa requirements for Belizean citizens''' are administrative entry restrictions by the authorities of other states placed on citizens of [[Belize]]. As of 2026, Belizean citizens had visa-free or visa on arrival access to 100 countries and territories, ranking the [[Belizean passport]] 46th overall, and last among [[Central America]]n countries, in terms of travel freedom according to the [[Visa (document)#Visa restrictions|Henley Passport Index]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=The Official Passport Index Ranking |url=https://www.henleyglobal.com/passport-index/ranking |access-date=2025-04-13 |website=Henley & Partners |language=en}}</ref>

